# Blog Cuisine — Project Context

Bilingual (fr/en) Astro 7 blog about food as cultural storytelling. Default locale is French.

## Stack

- Astro 7 + Content Collections (glob loader + Zod schema)
- MDX for recipe articles
- Tailwind CSS v4 (`@theme` tokens in `src/styles/global.css`)
- React islands only where client interactivity is needed (e.g. `ServingsScaler`)

## Development

Start the dev server in background mode:

```
astro dev --background
```

Manage with `astro dev stop`, `astro dev status`, and `astro dev logs`.

## Conventions

- Keep changes minimal and scoped to the task
- Prefer Astro components; reach for React only when client state is required
- Shared logic lives in `src/lib/` (e.g. `recipes.ts` for locale helpers)
- Consult [Astro docs](https://docs.astro.build) before routing, content, styling, or i18n changes

## Key paths

- Content: `src/content/recipes/{locale}/{slug}.mdx`
- Pages: `src/pages/{locale}/` (mirrored fr/en structure)
- Schema: `src/content.config.ts`
- Layout: `src/layouts/Layout.astro`
